<strong>\u00a0Moral Dilemmas with Real Stakes</strong> \u2013 Every decision impacts the shelter\u2019s future. Should you prioritize financial stability over waiting for the perfect adopter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/8733a8d9559b9ecd5d6a531487d88e1b.webp?t=1751325595\" /></span><strong>\u00a0Playful Cat Battles\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Inspired by classic fighting games, combat is anything but typical. Use <strong>real cat behaviors</strong> like ignoring foes for emotional damage, kicking litter, scratching, and even sitting on enemies\u2019 faces. Players execute on-screen key combos to attack, heal, or defend in a battle system unlike anything seen in standard RPGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/8733a8d9559b9ecd5d6a531487d88e1b.webp?t=1751325595\" /></span><strong>A Cat\u2019s Perspective on Communication</strong> \u2013 Matsue can only hear &quot;meow.&quot; You might be telling her to buy food, but she thinks you need the litter box cleaned. Misinterpretations affect how the shelter runs, leading to unexpected (and sometimes hilarious) outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/8733a8d9559b9ecd5d6a531487d88e1b.webp?t=1751325595\" /></span>\u00a0<strong>Real-World Impact \u2013 Support Shelters While You Play</strong> \u2013 Through <strong>limited-time in-game charity bundles</strong>, a portion of proceeds will go to real-life cat rescues. Players can unlock exclusive in-game rewards, such as cat outfits, shelter decorations, and special-themed items, while helping real cats in need.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/a13bd4ad4a851afba35d9d83ad8c048f.poster.avif?t=1751325595\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/a13bd4ad4a851afba35d9d83ad8c048f.apng?t=1751325595\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/0b412abc19644564a1506c32099406b7.webp?t=1751325595\" /></span>\u00a0Immerse yourself in a charming world blending pixel art and soft, painterly visuals. Experience warmth, humour, and depth in each moment spent at the shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One cat can change everything. Will you help Mikan transform Neko House into a prosperous sanctuary?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/633c3c641d40d567755853ad79c55c93.poster.avif?t=1751325595\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/633c3c641d40d567755853ad79c55c93.webm?t=1751325595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2317250/extras/633c3c641d40d567755853ad79c55c93.mp4?t=1751325595\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
